## Temp lifecycle

- `bootstrap/oodac_pure_build`: `trap` cleans `$TMP` on all exits.  
- `ooda_product.sh` run: `trap` removes temp binary.  
- `ooda_test_verify.sh`: `trap` removes harness/bin unless `OODA_TEST_KEEP=1`.

